    {
      "exercise": "209",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "用 $u_n$ 表示第 $n$ 项，一组可用的通项公式是：\na) $u_n=2n$。\nb) $u_n=2n-1$。\nc) $u_n=3n$。\nd) $u_n=n^2$。\ne) $u_n=\\frac{1}{n}$。\nf) $u_n=\\frac{n}{n+1}$。\n每个公式的定义域均为整数 $1\\leq n\\leq5$。代入这五个序号即可得到相应的五项。只要在这些序号上给出相同的值，其他公式也有效；题目并未要求唯一的无穷延续。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "This is a finite-domain formula task. Global expression equivalence would reject some formulas that are valid on 1<=n<=5, so the answer is ungraded rather than pretending the displayed continuation is unique."
    },
